{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"24":{"eng-name":"The Book of Hajj","ara-name":"كتاب مناسك الحج"}},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":2619,"hadithnumber_last":3084,"arabicnumber_first":2619,"arabicnumber_last":3084}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2662,"arabicnumber":2662,"text":"Rapporté par Anas bin Malik : Le Messager d'Allah ﷺ a prié la prière du Zuhr à Al-Baida, puis il est monté sur la montagne d'Al-Baida et a commencé la Talbiyah pour le Hajj et la 'Umrah après avoir prié le Zuhr. (faible)","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":44},"chapter":{"id":25,"ara-name":"باب الْبَيْدَاءِ .","eng-name":"Al-Baida","isFirstHadith":true}}]}